OL,3,GNEWSANew campaign to help victims know
OL,4,Atheir rights
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new campaign has been started to help
OL,7,Fpeople across the West Midlands better
OL,8,Funderstand their rights as victims of
OL,9,Fcrime.
OL,11,FThe project follows research showing
OL,12,Fthat just 2.5% of almost 1,000 people
OL,13,Fsurveyed could demonstrate any
OL,14,Fknowledge of the Victims' Code, more
OL,15,Fthan two decades after it was
OL,16,Fintroduced.
OL,18,FThe campaign is being led by West
OL,19,FMidlands Police and Crime Commissioner
OL,20,F(PCC) Simon Foster and Victims'
OL,21,FAdvocate Natalie Queiroz.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
