OL,3,GNEWSANew campaign to help victims know
OL,4,Atheir rights
OL,5,
OL,6,FDigital adverts will appear on mobile
OL,7,Fphones, digital billboards and public
OL,8,Ftransport, with a QR code linking
OL,9,Fdirectly to the PCC's Victims' Code
OL,10,Fwebpage, making it easier for people to
OL,11,Fcheck what they are entitled to.
